    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>Establishing an educational complex located at Ishbilia District, Riyadh, on a land area of 9,240 square meters, to accommodate 2,700 male and female students, with a capacity of 108 classes. It provides education services according to the American curriculum for both boys and girls, for all educational levels from kindergarten to Grade 12.</p>\r\n",
